# lantern — minimal smoke test for M2 (input loop, look, examine)

"Passing the Brass Lantern" by Bernd Eickhoff

Room kitchen "The kitchen smells of burnt coffee. A brass lantern sits on the table."
    north: hallway
    Object brass lantern, lamp "A tarnished brass lantern. The wick is dry."
    Object table "A sturdy wooden table."

Room hallway "A narrow hallway leading south to the kitchen."
    south: kitchen

on examine Object:thing:
    say "You see nothing special."

test
    look. "You look around"
    examine brass lantern. "nothing special"
    examine lamp. "nothing special"
